here's what happened when the foundation  put five pounds of raw ground beef into  the clockworks on rough a pound of  ground beef became a pound of beef  slurry on fine a pound of ground beef  became one medium-rare round steak on  another fine test a pound of ground beef  became a pound of beef jerky of equal  weight on the first very fine test a  pound of ground beef became a pair of  delicious half pound flank steaks well  done and lightly drizzled with gravy on  the second very fine test it became a  nightmarish creature that the foundation  was thankfully able to terminate before  it killed anybody
 

